    <item>
      <title>Queen Elysia</title>
      <link>https://northwaldia.com/characters/queen-elysia/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://northwaldia.com/characters/queen-elysia/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;biography&#34;&gt;Biography&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Queen Elysia is the co-ruler of &lt;a href=&#34;https://northwaldia.com/countries/northwaldia-country/&#34;&gt;Northwhaldia&lt;/a&gt;. Known throughout the realms as &amp;ldquo;The Keeper of the Keys,&amp;rdquo; she manages the kingdom&amp;rsquo;s vast cryptographic archives and ensure the stability of the realm&amp;rsquo;s core services.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;While her husband, &lt;a href=&#34;https://northwaldia.com/characters/king-aldric/&#34;&gt;King Aldric&lt;/a&gt;, focuses on rapid development and experimental &amp;ldquo;rolling&amp;rdquo; policies, Elysia is the voice of caution. She famously refused to update the kingdom&amp;rsquo;s primary firewall for three years, arguing that &amp;ldquo;if it isn&amp;rsquo;t broken, it&amp;rsquo;s secure.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
